 ## Background
-NeRF-RCNN was proposed in the paper "Instance Neural Radiance Field" [S1]. It is based on the architecture of Mask R-CNN [19] and extends NeRF-RPN [23]. The method was trained on a large NeRF segmentation dataset built on 3D-FRONT, a large-scale synthetic indoor scene dataset [S1]. The dataset includes 1015 scenes with multi-view images, camera poses, 3D bounding boxes, 2D ground truth instance segmentation, and 3D voxelized instance segmentation ground truth [S1].
+NeRF-RCNN was proposed in the paper "Instance Neural Radiance Field" [S1]. It is based on the architecture of Mask R-CNN [19] and extends NeRF-RPN [23] [S1]. The method was trained on a large NeRF segmentation dataset built on 3D-FRONT, a large-scale synthetic indoor scene dataset [S1]. The dataset includes 1015 scenes with multi-view images, camera poses, 3D bounding boxes, 2D ground truth instance segmentation, and 3D voxelized instance segmentation ground truth [S1].
 
